<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan money markets close for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan money markets close for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's money markets are closed on Tuesday for a domestic public holiday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the overnight interbank rate finished at 4.975 percent and the 30-day commercial paper ended at 4.90-5.00 percent.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
